  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Having to reach the toggle for enabling avatar sharing through an excessive number of clicks in the full Settings menu under a specific category is woefully useless.  The common usecase for it is not a binary toggle for either always avatar sharing or not as it seems to be designed,  the more typical usage of it is for enabling it briefly to share an avatar with someone.\n\nPlease just put a toggle in the quick settings menu off the launchpad near the top, if not somewhere in the settings off the Expression Menu too, to make accessing it as quick and convenient as possible.",
